From: shezw <hello@shezw.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 16:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] WPE 2.52.5: link WebKit with GioUnix and its includes

JingWei
tools/wpe/patches wpewebkit-2.52.5-gio-unix.patch    2026-07-18

Backport the WPE main-branch dependency required by
NetworkCacheDataGLib.cpp for gio/gfiledescriptorbased.h. The 2.52.5 WebKit
target does not propagate the imported GioUnix target's include usage
requirements to unified source compilation, so add them explicitly.

@link: https://github.com/shezw/JingWei
@author: shezw
@email: hello@shezw.com
---
 Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
--- a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
+++ b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWPE.cmake
@@ -465,8 +465,17 @@
 list(APPEND WebKit_PRIVATE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
     "${JavaScriptCoreGLib_DERIVED_SOURCES_DIR}/jsc"
 )
-
+
+get_target_property(GLIB_GIO_UNIX_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
+    GLib::GioUnix
+    INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
+)
+list(APPEND WebKit_SYSTEM_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
+    ${GLIB_GIO_UNIX_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES}
+)
+
 list(APPEND WebKit_LIBRARIES
+    GLib::GioUnix
     GLib::Module
     Soup3::Soup3
 )
--
2.43.0
